  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 6225 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E7", "E17"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 590126 of Bryant Ranch PrePack (FEI 1000519407) ended on 2009-06-11 and was classified OAI, with the classification known on 2009-09-09.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 6225 days before the most recent VAI inspection known date of 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Bryant Ranch Prepack plant (FEI 1000519407) appears on the label for NDC 71335063706 used at Corvale General.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same plant received a Warning Letter on 2010-04-08 and subsequent VAI inspections through 2026-07-16.",
      "cites": ["E16", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds only 7 days of warfarin sodium (18 units at 2.6 per day) while Corvale East holds 26 days (272 units at 10.5 per day).",
      "cites": ["D3", "D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 19 units from Corvale East to Corvale Lakeside would leave Corvale East with 19 days on hand and bring Corvale Lakeside to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
